# Fault relay K1 -- FAIL-SAFE (normally energized). The STM holds the
# coil ON while healthy; any fault -- or a dead STM, or loss of input
# power -- drops it, so the COM-NO loop the customer monitors BREAKS.
# 24V coil off protected VIN, low-side N-FET, gate default-OFF (relay
